RASENGAN — SELF-TRAINING NOTES (downloaded from the academy jutsu reference site)

Stage 1: Balloon-pop water exercise. Burst the balloon using rotation alone,
no direction/power. Most students take weeks. Master this in under a week or
don't bother going further, you'll just build bad habits.

Stage 2: Rubber ball exercise. Add power to the rotation without losing
containment. This is where most people plateau.

Stage 3: Full rasengan, no shadow clone assist. Traditionally takes years.

Shortcut note (unverified, forum post, use at own risk): using a shadow clone
to hold the rotation while you add power separately cuts training time
dramatically. This is apparently how the Fourth Hokage figured it out
originally under time pressure. Worth trying if the traditional method isn't
clicking.

Safety note: don't practice this near people or property you like.
